--- counter_reset_hint is 0..3 ---
--- schema is -4..8 or -53 ---
--- exponential buckets: the spans describe the buckets and go forwards after the first span ---
--- float histograms: no negative counts, the total count is not checked ---
--- integer histograms: the buckets and the zero bucket sum up to the count, or to at most the count when the sum is NaN ---
--- custom buckets: increasing finite bounds covering the spans, no negative side, no zero bucket ---
--- the accepted histograms ---
9
--- the histograms_max_buckets setting ---
1
